  "readmeExcerpt": "# Fresh Start\n\nThis repository is a placeholder for the original `nirholas/claude-code`, which was\ntaken down following a DMCA notice.\n\n**Status:** Working with Anthropic and GitHub to resolve the takedown. Once everything\nis cleared, the original content will return here.\n\nIn the meantime:\n\n- No releases, packages, or source from the original project are available in this repository.\n- Watch this repo to be notified when it is restored.\n\n## License\n\nAll rights reserved. See [LICENSE](LICENSE).\n",
  "readmeHtml": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Fresh Start</h1></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This repository is a placeholder for the original <code>nirholas/claude-code</code>, which was\ntaken down following a DMCA notice.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Status:</strong> Working with Anthropic and GitHub to resolve the takedown. Once everything\nis cleared, the original content will return here.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In the meantime:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>No releases, packages, or source from the original project are available in this repository.</li>\n<li>Watch this repo to be notified when it is restored.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All rights reserved. See <a href=\"https://github.com/nirholas/claude-code/blob/clean-start/LICENSE\">LICENSE</a>.</p>\n</article></div>",
